# The game keeps all its state in the query string, never in paths, so any
# unknown path should still serve the app rather than a 404.
#
# This lives in public/ so Vite copies it INTO dist. netlify.toml only applies
# to a git-connected build — a drag-and-drop of the dist folder never sees it,
# and would silently lose these rules.
/*  /index.html  200
